<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-042" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered" source-id="s-nanqishu-042-current-rendered-xiaochen-near-family">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="5c7_6at_22b_AA">蕭諶</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="5c7_6at_22b_AA">彥孚</persName>，南蘭陵蘭陵人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="5c7_6at_22b">道清</persName>，員外郎。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="5c7_6at_22b_A">仙伯</persName>，桂陽國參軍。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p002:m0001" ref="5c7_6at_22b_AA">諶</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p002:m0002" ref="5c7_6at_22b_AB">誄</persName>，與<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p002:m0003" ref="5c7_6at_22b_AA">諶</persName>同豫廢立，爲寧朔將軍、東莞太守，轉西中郎司馬。建武初，封西昌侯，千戶。轉太子左率。領軍解司州圍還，同伏誅。<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p002:m0004" ref="5c7_6at_22b_AA">諶</persName>伯父<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaochen-near-family-rendered:p002:m0005" ref="xn9_pvd_fy9">仙民</persName>，官至太中大夫，卒。</p>
</text>
